OL,3,GNEWSACall for volunteers to get
OL,4,Ainvolved in sport
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being encouraged to get
OL,7,Finvolved in sports to help tackle a
OL,8,F"shortage of volunteers".
OL,10,FJersey Sport is hosting its first
OL,11,FVolunteering in Sports Fair in a bid to
OL,12,Fbring together members of the public
OL,13,Fand sporting organisations to showcase
OL,14,Fthe wide range of volunteering
OL,15,Fopportunities available across the
OL,16,Fisland.
OL,18,FThe event will take place between 12:00
OL,19,Fand 14:00 BST at the Pomme d'Or Hotel
OL,20,Fin St Helier on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
